  unitName: Demented Girl Jeanne (EU)
  unitId: 750264
  unitNumber: 7214
  description: "A young girl with fragile mental stability. Many who crossed her
    path only thought she was crazy. She claims to hear voices but nobody believes
    her, not even the inhabitants of her native village. Nonetheless, she managed
    to obtain a post with the local guards. Despite her instability, she could stay
    thanks to her ability with the sword and sense of duty. Later, she joined Heinrich's
    hunting party and took part in humanity\u2019s rebellion against the Shapeshifters,
    pledging her support to its instigators. Her natural ability was not by chance:
    she descended from a unique lineage whose distinctive features had been lost
    throughout the centuries. She had been the first in a very long time to have
    the mysterious ability to hear certain voices."
  summonDesc: Why won't anybody believe me?! These voices...
  fusionDesc: No... I'm not crazy!
